<title>PORTUGAL: Cimpor 'green shoe' shares trade Friday.</title>
<headline>Cimpor 'green shoe' shares trade Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 2.84 million shares from the 'green shoe' option exercised at this week's privatisation of 45 percent of cement group Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal will be admitted to trade on Friday, the Lisbon bourse said.</p>
<p>The green shoe was used to provide additional shares to institutional investors because of heavy demand at the sale.</p>
<p>Cimpor stock closed at 3,242 escudos ($21) per share on Thursday against the privatisation price of 3,170.</p>
<p>($1=155.25 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
